# Export Control and ITAR Compliance Policy

**Document Type:** Corporate Policy
**Authority Level:** 1 (Authoritative)
**Policy Number:** POL-009
**Effective Date:** January 1, 2024
**Last Reviewed:** January 2026
**Owner:** VP Trade Compliance
**Classification:** Internal

---

## Purpose

This policy establishes Nexus Industries' commitment and procedures for complying with U.S. export control laws, including ITAR (International Traffic in Arms Regulations) and EAR (Export Administration Regulations).

---

## Scope

This policy applies to:
- All employees handling controlled items or data
- All exports of products, technology, and services
- Defense articles and defense services
- Dual-use items and technology
- All divisions and locations
- Foreign person access to controlled information

---

## Regulatory Framework

### Key Regulations

| Regulation | Authority | Scope |
|------------|-----------|-------|
| ITAR (22 CFR 120-130) | State Department/DDTC | Defense articles, services |
| EAR (15 CFR 730-774) | Commerce/BIS | Dual-use items |
| OFAC Sanctions | Treasury | Restricted parties/countries |
| AECA | Congress | Arms Export Control Act |

