## Foreign Person Access

### Definition

**Foreign Person:** Anyone who is not a U.S. citizen, permanent resident, or protected person (refugee/asylee)

### Requirements

| Controlled Item | Access Rule |
|-----------------|-------------|
| ITAR | No access without license or exemption |
| EAR (controlled) | Per license requirements |
| EAR99 | Generally permitted |

### Technology Control Plan

| Control | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Physical | Locked areas, badge access |
| IT | Network segregation, access controls |
| Personnel | Foreign person roster |
| Meetings | Attendee screening |
| Visitors | Escort, briefing |

