## Prohibited Activities

### Never:
- Export without proper authorization
- Provide ITAR data to foreign persons without license
- Share technical data via unsecured channels
- Host foreign nationals in controlled areas
- Assume foreign subsidiaries can receive controlled items
- Make false statements on licenses
- Violate sanctions or embargoes

### Restricted Countries

| Category | Countries |
|----------|-----------|
| ITAR Prohibited | All unlicensed exports prohibited |
| OFAC Sanctions | Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, etc. |
| Country Group D | Enhanced scrutiny (EAR) |

