## Violations and Reporting

### Violation Indicators

- Unauthorized disclosure
- Unlicensed export
- Foreign person access without authorization
- Missed license conditions
- Diversion attempts

### Reporting Requirements

| Discovery | Action | Timeline |
|-----------|--------|----------|
| Potential violation | Report to Trade Compliance | Immediately |
| Confirmed violation | Voluntary disclosure consideration | <60 days recommended |
| Security incident | Also report to Security | Immediately |

### Penalties

| Violation Type | Civil Penalty | Criminal Penalty |
|----------------|---------------|------------------|
| ITAR | Up to $1.3M/violation | Up to 20 years, $1M |
| EAR | Up to $300K or 2x value | Up to 20 years, $1M |
| OFAC | Up to $1M/violation | Up to 30 years, $10M |

